Construction Risk Analysis of Pile Foundation of
Side Crossing Corridor Bridge in Curved Shield Tunnel Construction
FANG Shui⁃ping
( Fuzhou Gandong Highway Design Institute Co.,Ltd.,Fuzhou,Jiangxi 344000,China)
Abstract:Based on the research background of the shield tunnel of Maglev Express Line East Extension passing through the airport
bridge pile foundation,the numerical calculation model of shield tunneling along the curved section is constructed,and the variation law of
ground settlement and pile foundation settlement during shield tunneling is analyzed. The results show that the maximum settlement posi⁃
tion of the shield tunneling along the curved section occurs at the inner side of the curved section,which is different from the distribution
of the surface settlement trough in the straight section;After the double track is cut through,the surface settlement trough is symmetrically
distributed with the tunnel centerline;After the shield machine passes through the pile,the disturbance to the pile foundation is intensi⁃
fied,and the excavation disturbance to the pile foundation closer to the excavation tunnel is more obvious;The surface and pile settlement
meet the construction control standards,and the construction risk is within the allowable range of control. The disturbance effect of double
track excavation on pile 1 is greater,and the maximum stress value is increases by 76% compared with that before excavation.
Keywords:shield tunnel;curved shield;pile foundation of covered bridge;construction risk
